      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "玩家亲自操控英雄参战，并从三种优势与打法不同的职业中选择",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Fight directly as the hero with class-based abilities Choose from 3 playable classes, each with distinct strengths and playstyles",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/4642990/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
